# L1: EXACTNESS of the lanes and of D0, every audit on. The gate's lanes-exact plan on the four real-text prompts (4,096 / 16,384 /
# 32,768 / 60,000 tokens, 1,024 out), three arms, one boot each:
#   ref-solo     c2-packed-tp4-gate            each user alone on the per-request engines: the reference
#   d0-solo      c2-packed-tp4-solo-gate       each user alone on the one-user 16-row block (D0, QWEN_FAST_SOLO_LANE)
#   lanes-mixed  c2-packed-tp4-lanes-gate      user 0 fast beside three standard users; QWEN_FAST_LANE_SCHEDULE sweeps the ratio on the boot
#                                              (k = 2, 1, 0.5, 0, high k first, 25 frames each with every lane live, then the controller), so every
#                                              frame shape runs: solo rounds, packed rounds, the switch between them, users joining and leaving
# Every text under D0 and under the lanes must equal its text alone on the per-request engines (the strict policy: a reproduced
# divergence FAILS, never NOT_COMPARABLE, because the lane flags are exactness claims; a first divergence re-runs that arm and the
# reference once). The runtimes must have engaged and alternated: no solo round, or a schedule the worker never read, is NOT_EXERCISED or
# FAIL by name. Every audit the profiles carry is on (the T1 shard argmax against the pinned sampler, T2 windows, the extent audit).
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the four-card lanes window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it
# over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/lanes and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig,
# a card or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG names the image L0 builds from this same commit; a later commit needs a new tag.
# C2_GATE_JIT=record: D0's M=16 programs and the lane profiles compile on their first arms; the growth is recorded, not judged.
# Duration (estimate): reset 1-3 min; per arm an engine build 3-8 min (10-30 the first time D0's programs compile) plus 2-6 min of
# streams: 35-100 min for three arms; a divergence re-runs its arm and the reference: up to 180 min. Step limit 380 min; the plan's
# worst case (every arm to its 55-minute limit, every re-run) is 342 min.
# Read: the ready line and the launched-argv line per arm (profile, QWEN_FAST_TP=4); every packed-any admission UNQUALIFIED line (only
# the pending evidence sections are expected); "[SOLO-LANE] round" lines in d0-solo and lanes-mixed and in no other arm; "[LANE] engaged"
# with the schedule, one "[LANE-ADMIT] ... asked=fast granted=fast slots=0", and the "[LANE-ROUND]" lines only in lanes-mixed; the
# summary's lanes rows (one per ratio stretch, the model's frame beside the measured one); NO audit mismatch anywhere.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset gate
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-lanes-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-gate
C2_GATE_PLAN=lanes-exact
C2_GATE_JIT=record
